  "findings": [
    "All three productionclasses implement Eloquent query-scope normalization, correlated SELECT1 LIMIT1 aliases and boolean casts. No file/image hashes, distance metric, candidate index, content matcher, duplicate deletion or dedup pipeline.",
    "makeCallable uses Arr.wrap, numeric entries as zeroargument scopes and associative entries as dynamic scopes; callbackreturns originalbuilder. Macro creates fresh aliasedmodel, correlates qualifiedprimary keys and attaches query-time positive/negativeboolean cast.",
    "Ten authored upstream testmethods cover callable/string/multiple/dynamic/inline/outerconstraint/flip/selfrelation cases; all read, none executed.",
    "Test migration down drops only posts while up creates posts/comments/videos. Static observation only, no database failure claim.",
    "README zero-thirdpartydependencies phrasing does not imply standalone implementation: composer requires illuminate/support and tests require Laravel Testbench/PHPUnit. No composerlock tracked; workflow installs floating version ranges."
  ],
